{"games":[{"id":14913354249,"name":"[Versace Update] LensCrafters Eye Odyssey","desc":"Your Vision Tycoon is getting spooky with brand new Halloween themed stores, props and exclusive seasonal rewards.\n\n🕸️ Discover the Halloween Collection — build new locations across your park.\n👻Decorate your empire with spooky furniture and creepy-cute haunted details.\n👓 Help customers find their perfect look and grow your optical business — even monsters need to see clearly!\n🍬Collect limited time Halloween UGC to complete your most spook-tacular style.\n\nTrick. Treat. Tycoon. Welcome to LensCrafters Halloween Vision Tycoon!","path":"/game/14913354249-lenscrafters-eye-odyssey","slug":"14913354249-lenscrafters-eye-odyssey","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ea7317b2d9684ef35199a01cdb2039ad0e77d2d023668d3618faede46caba1e3.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-9bba7f06a0a12b7c5d753854174ff0d4/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":1151274,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-02-17T07:41:30.799Z","creator":{"name":"LensCrafters","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":14798839770,"name":"Blade Ball Practice","desc":"👍 Like the game for UPDATES and make sure to join the community server below to talk with the devs and see sneak peeks!\n\n☄️ The original Blade Ball \"Practice\" (BBP) game and our own take on the game genre! You can instantly respawn without having to wait for the match to end OR practice the game solo!\n\n⚔️ Time your guard perfectly to deflect the homing ball to someone else.\n\n🤖 Make a private server to practice one on one against an NPC.\n\n🎮 Controls:\n- BLOCK: Left Click / F / Button / R1\n- ABILITY: Right Click + Shift Lock / Q / Button / ButtonX\n- SHIFTLOCK: Shift / Button / ButtonY\n\nFounder: Staticaliza (PROXDGAMER00)\nOwner: Zaixoz\n\nDISCLAIMER: This game uses its OWN assets and didn't steal from Blade Ball, the idea of Blade Ball itself is taken from minigames in other game